000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. CURRSIGN.
000300* CURRENCY SIGN and DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA are Nucleus level 1.
000400* With both in force, 'F' stands where '$' would in a PICTURE, the
000500* comma is the decimal point in pictures and numeric literals, and
000600* the period is the insertion character the comma usually is.
000650* R is shown through an edited item: GnuCOBOL inserts a decimal
000660* point when it DISPLAYs a plain PIC 9V9 item, and the standard
000670* does not -- V occupies no character position.
000700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000800 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
000900 SPECIAL-NAMES.
001000     CURRENCY SIGN IS 'F'
001100     DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
001200 DATA DIVISION.
001300 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001400 01  AMT          PIC S9(7)V99 VALUE 1234567,89.
001500 01  SMALL        PIC S9(7)V99 VALUE -12,5.
001600 01  E-FLOAT      PIC FFF.FFF.FF9,99.
001700 01  E-FIXED      PIC F9.999.999,99.
001800 01  E-ZED        PIC ZZ.ZZZ.ZZ9,99-.
001900 01  E-PLAIN      PIC 9.999.999,99.
002000 01  HALF         PIC 9V9  VALUE 0,5.
002100 01  R            PIC 9(3)V9(3).
002150 01  E-R          PIC 999,999.
002200 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002300 MAIN.
002400     MOVE AMT TO E-FLOAT E-FIXED E-ZED E-PLAIN.
002500     DISPLAY '[' E-FLOAT '] [' E-FIXED ']'.
002550     DISPLAY '[' E-ZED '] [' E-PLAIN ']'.
002600     MOVE SMALL TO E-FLOAT E-FIXED E-ZED.
002700     DISPLAY '[' E-FLOAT '] [' E-FIXED ']'.
002750     DISPLAY '[' E-ZED ']'.
002800     MOVE 7,25 TO E-FLOAT.
002900     DISPLAY '[' E-FLOAT ']'.
003000     MULTIPLY HALF BY 3,5 GIVING R.
003100     MOVE R TO E-R. DISPLAY '[' E-R ']'.
003200     ADD 0,125 TO R.
003300     MOVE R TO E-R. DISPLAY '[' E-R ']'.
003400     STOP RUN.
